Added Virtual Machine assignment support to the Policy and NATPolicy models via `assigned_virtual_machines`.
Added `PolicyVirtualMachineM2M` and `NATPolicyVirtualMachineM2M` through models with REST API endpoints.
Added "Edit Virtual Machine Weight" tab to the Policy and NATPolicy detail views.
Added "Security Policies Directly Assigned" and "Security Policies via Dynamic Groups" panels to the Virtual Machine detail view.
